---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"; import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro"; import { Picture } from "astro:assets"; import farmImage from "../assets/images/farm-morning.webp"; import goatImage from "../assets/images/goat-portrait.webp"; import { breadcrumbSchema } from "../utils/schema"; import { withBase } from "../config/site";
---
<BaseLayout title="About Our Goat Dairy Near Pune | Hello Honey Bunny" description="Hello Honey Bunny is a small goat dairy in Kunjirwadi, Maharashtra 412201, near Pune. Learn how availability and farm visits are confirmed." canonicalPath="/our-farm" activePage="farm" image={farmImage.src} imageAlt="Goats standing near a timber farm shelter" schema={breadcrumbSchema([{name:"Home",path:"/"},{name:"Our Farm",path:"/our-farm"}])}><main id="main"><Breadcrumbs items={[{name:"Home",path:"/"},{name:"Our Farm"}]} /><section class="page-intro"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Kunjirwadi, near Pune</p><h1>A small goat dairy in Kunjirwadi near Pune</h1><p class="lede">Hello Honey Bunny works in small batches, shares availability honestly and confirms every current request personally.</p></div><div class="hero-media"><Picture src={farmImage} formats={["avif"]} fallbackFormat="webp" widths={[480,768,1100]} sizes="(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 48vw" alt="Goats standing near a timber farm shelter" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" /></div></div></section><section class="section section-cream"><div class="container feature-grid"><article class="feature"><h2>Responsible-care principles</h2><p>Our public promise is modest: work at a limited scale, communicate clearly and avoid making claims about farm practices that have not been confirmed for publication.</p></article><article class="feature"><h2>Honest availability</h2><p>The farm does not publish live stock levels. Milk, paneer, pack sizes, final pricing and fulfilment details are confirmed person to person.</p></article></div></section><section class="section" id="photos"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Farm photographs</p><h2>Scenes from the existing farm collection</h2><p>These existing images are retained as the current farm photo set and should be replaced if the business cannot verify their provenance.</p></div><div class="photo-grid"><Picture src={farmImage} formats={["avif"]} fallbackFormat="webp" widths={[480,768,1100]} sizes="(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 66vw" alt="Goats near a timber shelter in morning light" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><Picture src={goatImage} formats={["avif"]} fallbackFormat="webp" widths={[360,560]} sizes="(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 33vw" alt="A young goat standing among grasses" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div></div></section><section class="section section-forest"><div class="container split-grid"><div><h2>Visits require prior confirmation</h2><p>The farm does not publish public opening hours or private directions.</p></div><div><p>Contact us before making plans. A message registers your interest but does not confirm a visit until we reply with an agreed arrangement.</p><a class="button button-light" href={withBase("/contact")}>Contact the farm</a></div></div></section></main></BaseLayout>
